Package: com.adarsh.gifstashkey
Name: GIF Stash Button
Version: 1.0.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: A GIF Stash button in the bar under the keyboard. Tap it to see the clips saved in GIF Stash, playing, in place of the keyboard; tap one and it is pasted into the message you are writing. The button shows GIF Stash's icon as your SnowBoard theme draws it. Needs the GIF Stash app.
Maintainer: Adarsh
Author: Adarsh
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit
